    "description": "### Problem Description\\nBuild a production-ready Interactive Counter with Step component in React conforming to modern best practices.\\n\\n### Key Capabilities:\\n1. Robust state modeling with React 19 hooks.\\n2. Smooth user interactions, event handling & keyboard accessibility.\\n3. Complete edge case handling (empty states, boundaries, clean timer cancellation).",
